problem-13-s3.c:78:0:high:Flawfinder strcpy: Does not check for buffer overflows when copying to destination [MS-banned] (CWE-120). Consider using snprintf, strcpy_s, or strlcpy (warning: strncpy easily misused). (risk 4, buffer)
